ent-BaseWeaponLightMachineGun = 基礎武器輕機槍 | BaseWeaponLightMachineGun
    .desc = 一款超棒的隨拍相機。 | A rooty tooty point and shooty.
ent-WeaponLightMachineGunL6 = L6 SAW | L6 SAW
    .desc = 由瓦夫爾公司（Waffle Corp）研發的 L6 小隊自動武器，是一款致命的輕機槍，常被戈萊克斯掠奪者（Gorlex Marauders）所使用。儘管體積龐大且笨重，但其厚重的槍管與大彈匣容量，使其能以密集的子彈雨完美壓制敵軍。採用 .30 口徑彈帶供彈。 | Developed by Waffle Corp, the L6 Squad Automatic Weapon is a deadly light machine gun often used by the Gorlex Marauders. Although bulky and cumbersome, its heavy barrel and high ammo capacity make it perfect for suppressing combatants with a hail of bullets. Feeds from .30 ammo belts.
ent-WeaponLightMachineGunL6C = L6C ROW | L6C ROW
    .desc = 一款供賽博格使用的 L6 SAW 機槍。透過內建的彈藥製造器，能即時製造 .30 口徑步槍彈藥，且該製造器會緩慢地自動充電。 | A L6 SAW for use by cyborgs. Creates .30 rifle ammo on the fly from an internal ammo fabricator, which slowly self-charges.
